trait_Mol.png/25px-Portrait_Mol.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Portrait_Mol.png/38px-Portrait_Mol.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Portrait_Mol.png/50px-Portrait_Mol.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mol\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Portrait_Mol.png/25px-Portrait_Mol.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/43/Portrait_Mol.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mol\" title=\"Mol\">Mol</a></li>\n<li>Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nansi_Gretta\" title=\"Nansi Gretta\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/25px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/38px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/50px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nansi Gretta\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/25px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nansi_Gretta\" title=\"Nansi Gretta\">Nansi Gretta</a></li>\n<li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Village\" title=\"Blighted Village\">Blighted Village</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;15&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;362</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Leira\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Leira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Leira\">Leira</a></span>, Lady of Deception\n</p><p>the goddess who wears many masks.\n</p><p>Invoke Her name - avoid perception\n</p><p>She hides your lies and secret tasks.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>For joy, to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Lliira\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lliira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Lliira\">Lliira</a></span> you must call\n</p><p>And worship Her through soulfelt dance.\n</p><p>So find Her presence in festhalls;\n</p><p>Do not give idleness a chance.\n</p><p><br>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Loviatar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Loviatar\">Loviatar's</a> pleasure is your pain,\n</p><p>Your scars an offering.\n</p><p>Scourge or candle, whip or cane,\n</p><p>Can your devotion bring.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>The other books of this series are:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_is_for_Azuth,_and_other_Gods_I\" title=\"A is for Azuth, and other Gods I\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/25px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/38px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/50px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/25px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/A_is_for_Azuth,_and_other_Gods_I\" title=\"A is for Azuth, and other Gods I\">A is for Azuth, and other Gods I</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_is_for_Azuth,_and_other_Gods_II\" title=\"A is for Azuth, and other Gods II\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/25px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/38px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/50px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/